{"data": [{"author_id": "2051647851823022080", "created_at": "2026-11-16T13:30:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122321448178217215"], "id": "2122321448178217215", "note_tweet": {"text": "11 月 15 日刚更新的全球大模型综合实力前五名里，国产模型终于占了一个席位：\n\n第一名 Claude Opus 5.5（61.4%）、\n\n第二名 Gemini 4 Argon（57.1%）、\n\n第三名 GPT-6 Astra（54.7%）、\n\n第四名 Meta Muse Wonder Full（53.6%）、\n\n第五名 Kimi K3.1 Pro（52.5%）。\n\n有意思的是，排第五的 Kimi K3.1 Pro 每次提问的花费大约只要五分钱人民币，而排第三的 GPT-6 Astra 一次要花到它五倍的钱。\n\n不知道今天刚发布的 Qwen 4 Max 能排第几？"}, "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "11 月 15 日刚更新的全球大模型综合实力前五名里，国产模型终于占了一个席位：\n\n第一名 Claude Opus 5.5（61.4%）、\n\n第二名 Gemini 4 Argon（57.1%）、\n\n第三名 GPT-6 Astra（54.7%）、\n\n第四名 Meta Muse Wonder Full（53.6%）、\n\n第五名 Kimi K3.1 Pro（52.5%）。\n\n有意思的是，排第五的 Kimi K3.1", "url": "https://x.com/Wavequester/status/2122321448178217215"}, {"author_id": "2016764273280897024", "created_at": "2026-11-16T13:28:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122320964742742406"], "id": "2122320964742742406", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@gisael @amazon @AIatMeta @Meta @Muse @bot @spacexai If your agent is blocked by Amazon, Yelp, Delta, etc. Now you can ask the agent to go to https://t.co/rI7T3B59gD and then go from there. Sophtron provides a browser stack to get unblocked access and let the agent drive the rest.", "url": "https://x.com/opal_life_/status/2122320964742742406"}, {"author_id": "101825923", "created_at": "2026-11-16T13:19:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122318756693032964"], "id": "2122318756693032964", "note_tweet": {"text": "DocsBot Agent marketplace submission status:\n✅ ChatGPT/Codex: tool 3 rounds of MCP server rearchitecting\n✅ Claude/Code: Fairly easy approval, just confusing (connector and plugin different)\n⏳ Meta Muse: Did nearly day 1. Huge backlog, created a