nt": 0}, "text": "Tip of the Day: How to use Meta Muse, the Proactive AI Agent that works when you don’t https://t.co/jSbqhDEaHT https://t.co/X3YcJtZ6Lz", "url": "https://x.com/delao/status/2122314928652464324"}, {"author_id": "1892607768991068160", "created_at": "2026-11-16T13:02:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122314275758678220"], "id": "2122314275758678220", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "What is Meta Muse? How it saved me $500, and why it's a threat to retail media https://t.co/qVODbVpLhS", "url": "https://x.com/Camahueto/status/2122314275758678220"}, {"author_id": "2109028803519332353", "created_at": "2026-11-16T13:01:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122314155042509000"], "id": "2122314155042509000", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Meta Muse Image ليس مجرد مولّد صورة من وصف نصي؛ إحدى نقاط قوته المعلنة هي تركيب مشهد اعتماداً على عدة صور مرجعية، مثل شخص من صورة، ودراجة من أخرى، وملابس من ثالثة.", "url": "https://x.com/PixelAIArab/status/2122314155042509000"}, {"author_id": "154489160", "created_at": "2026-11-16T13:00:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122313887001530522"], "id": "2122313887001530522", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@haru_datsusara Meta Museの設定紹介、参考になります！AIエージェントのPickleもおすすめです！チャットで頼むだけで、調べ物・文章作成・情報集めを代わりにやってくれます✨ こんな感じで日常の作業を丸投げできます！ 登録はこちら→ https://t.co/y5AhxNmGmQ", "url": "https://x.com/fx_skywalker/status/2122313887001530522"}, {"author_id": "174562188", "created_at": "2026-11-16T13:00:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122313760622997688"], "id": "2122313760622997688", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 21, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "MetaのパーソナルAIエージェント「Muse」始めました！\n登録後48時間以内に設定から紹介コードを入れると、お互い10億Museトークンもらえます。\nコード：VH6CFJ\n登録はこちら → https://t.co/qptIIe54CY\n先に入れておくとお得です！\n#Muse #MetaMuse #紹介コード", "url": "https://x.com/nonrin123/status/2122313760622997688"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2122311948381650944"]}, "author_id": "2781499375", "created_at": "2026-11-16T12:52:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122311972389847064"], "id": "2122311972389847064", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 75, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🤖 Meta Museを利用している方へ！\n\nMuseをこれから始める方。\n新規登録時に招待コードを入力で紹介特典をGET‼️\n\n🎁 招待コード：S2DIYD\n\nMuseを一緒に楽しみましょう❗️\n\n#MetaMuse #Muse #招待コード https://t.co/tIFI5NLX9P", "url": "https://x.com/trout20001101/status/2122311972389847064"}, {"author_id": "2588920531", "created_at": "2026-11-16T12:50:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122311359673377212"], "id": "2122311359673377212", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 30, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Meta『Muse』使ってみた｜ミケ先生@フォロバ100 「やってみたい」をAIと一緒に。｜介護・終活・相続・在宅ワーク @maikosue https://t.co/aqgWLHUa8Z", "url": "https://x.com/enattendanttoi/status/2122311359673377212"}, {"author_id": "1997695916627922944", "created_at": "2026-11-16T12:32:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122306690871620085"], "id": "2122306690871620085", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 158, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 7, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Another coding agent enters the competition.\n\nMeta Muse Code, Claude Code and Codex are pushing AI-assisted development forward.\n\nBut let's ask:\n\n1-Which one understands complex codebases better?\n2-Which one produces maintainable code?\n3-Which one would you trust in production?", "url": "https://x.com/harikesh_devops/status/2122306690871620085"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_21